<wxs module="ui" src="../../shared/ui/presentation.wxs" />
<view class="rental-page">
  <view class="page-heading"><text class="eyebrow">我的租赁 · 合同与进度</text><text class="page-title">租赁详情</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading-state">正在读取租赁详情…</view><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{ui.message(error)}}</text><navigator wx:if="{{error}}" class="text-link" url="/pages/identity/login">重新登录 ›</navigator>
  <view wx:if="{{contract}}">
    <view class="panel"><view class="card-row"><text class="section-title break-id">{{contract.contractNumber}}</text><text class="status-badge">{{ui.label(contract.status)}}</text></view><view class="data-row"><text class="data-label">开始日期</text><text class="data-value">{{contract.rentalStartDate}}</text></view><view class="data-row"><text class="data-label">租赁时长</text><text class="data-value">{{contract.rentalDays}} 天</text></view><view class="amount-panel"><text class="amount-label">合同应付合计</text><text class="amount">{{contract.amountDue}}</text></view>
      <text class="section-title">计费依据</text>
      <text class="description">初始租金为各件装备日租金快照 × 约定整日天数后求和；历史快照不随现价变动。按 Europe/Oslo 本地日历整日计费，不按小时折算。</text>
      <text class="description">普通提前归还不自动退款。正式调整只退尚未开始的剩余整日，新增装备包含调整当日。合同应付合计包含已确认调整，不是当前未付余额；补缴、退款及办理状态请核对下方费用和变更记录。</text>
      <button wx:if="{{contract.status === 'PENDING_CONFIRMATION'}}" type="primary" bindtap="confirm">核对并确认合同</button>
      <button class="invoice-entry button-secondary" bindtap="viewInvoice">查看发票 / 模拟付款</button>
      <text wx:if="{{contract.status === 'ENDED'}}" class="notice">如仍在原租赁日期内，已归还装备尚有未完成的正式退款，可提交后续减租申请，由门店核对。</text>
      <button wx:if="{{contract.status === 'ACTIVE' || contract.status === 'ENDED'}}" class="button-secondary" bindtap="requestChange">{{contract.status === 'ENDED' ? '申请后续正式退款' : '申请变更 / 部分归还'}}</button>
    </view>
    <view class="panel"><text class="section-title">租赁装备</text><view wx:for="{{contract.items}}" wx:key="itemId" class="item-card"><view class="card-row"><text class="item-name break-id">装备 {{item.equipmentId}}</text><text class="status-badge">{{ui.label(item.status)}}</text></view><text class="item-meta">日租金快照 · {{item.dailyRateSnapshot}} / 天</text><text class="item-meta">发放：{{item.checkedOutAt || '尚未发放'}}</text><text class="item-meta">归还：{{item.returnedAt || '尚未归还'}}</text><text wx:if="{{!item.active}}" class="item-meta">历史项目</text></view></view>
    <view class="panel"><text class="section-title">费用明细</text><view wx:if="{{contract.charges.length === 0}}" class="inline-empty">暂未生成费用记录</view><view wx:for="{{contract.charges}}" wx:key="chargeId" class="data-row"><view><text class="item-name">{{ui.label(item.type)}}</text><text class="item-meta">{{ui.label(item.status)}}</text></view><text class="data-value">{{item.amount}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="panel"><text class="section-title">交易结果记录</text><text class="description">包含顾客模拟付款与门店登记的外部交易结果。</text><view wx:if="{{transactions.length === 0}}" class="inline-empty">暂无交易结果</view><view wx:for="{{transactions}}" wx:key="transactionId" class="item-card"><view class="card-row"><text class="item-name break-id">{{item.externalId}}</text><text class="status-badge">{{ui.label(item.status)}}</text></view><text class="item-meta">{{item.source === 'SIMULATED' ? '顾客模拟付款 · 不扣款' : '外部交易 · 门店登记'}}</text><text class="item-meta">金额 · {{item.amount}}</text><text class="item-meta">{{item.processedAt || '处理时间待确认'}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="panel"><text class="section-title">变更记录</text><view wx:if="{{changes.length === 0}}" class="inline-empty">暂无合同变更</view><view wx:for="{{changes}}" wx:key="changeId" class="item-card"><view class="card-row"><text class="item-name">{{ui.label(item.type)}}</text><text class="status-badge">{{ui.label(item.status)}}</text></view><text class="item-meta">{{item.requestedAt}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="item-meta">{{item.note}}</text><text class="item-meta">金额变化 · {{item.amountDelta === null ? '待核定' : item.amountDelta}}</text><button class="button-secondary review-button" size="mini" data-id="{{item.changeId}}" bindtap="reviewChange" disabled="{{loading || deciding}}">查看方案与报价</button></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{proposal}}" class="panel quote-panel"><view class="card-row"><text class="section-title">{{ui.label(proposal.change.type)}}方案</text><text class="status-badge">{{ui.label(proposal.change.status)}}</text></view><text class="item-meta">生效日期 · {{proposal.change.effectiveDate || '待确定'}}</text><view class="amount-panel"><text class="amount-label">核定金额变化</text><text class="amount">{{proposal.change.amountDelta === null ? '待核定' : proposal.change.amountDelta}}</text></view><text class="notice">新增装备计入生效整日；原装备退款仅计尚未开始的剩余整日。付款或退款请按门店指引办理。</text><view wx:for="{{proposal.items}}" wx:key="itemId"><view wx:if="{{item.effect}}" class="item-card"><text class="item-name">{{ui.label(item.effect)}} · 装备 {{item.equipmentId}}</text><text class="item-meta">{{item.dailyRateSnapshot}} / 天 · {{ui.label(item.status)}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{proposal.change.status === 'PROCESSING' && proposal.change.amountDelta !== null}}"><button type="primary" bindtap="confirmAdjustment" loading="{{deciding}}" disabled="{{deciding || loading}}">确认项目与金额</button><button class="button-plain reject-button" bindtap="rejectAdjustment" disabled="{{deciding || loading}}">拒绝本次报价</button><text class="caption quote-footnote">拒绝报价不撤销已完成的实物归还。</text></view></view>
  </view>
</view>
